        <p>How Suffering, Blood- less Women are made Rosy and Well by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills</p>
        <p>Girls and women who become listless victims of Anemia—that is, Bloodless- ness feel too weak, too -wretched, too hopeless to take prompt steps and stop the mischief. That is the danger. Too often they drift into a -worse state through neglect, forgetting that Ailxmia some- times leads on/to Consumption. Lose no time if you are anemic; increase and en- rich your blood, giving it new nourishment, by taking Mr. Williams' Pink Pills for .RVEY (from Pale People, for by making 'Good Red Blood they have cured more unhappy, anremic girls and women Ulan any other medicine known. • Miss, Nellie llarvey, of 197, Parkhurst Road, Manor Park, Essex, is one of these cured people, and her statement is printed here because it is just the kind of case that Dr. Williams' Pink Pills are curing every day. She states:— "'When told by the, doctor that I was suffering from Amcmia, that would take a long course of medicine and rest to cure, I was nearly heartbroken.</p>
