        <p>HOCKEY.</p>
        <p>LATCEIFORD.</p>
        <p>No hockey was possible last Saturday owing to the snow:</p>
        <p>This afternoon the first eleven at Winnington Park is :—H Ridley, goal ; W Fletcher, J B Wilkinson,backs; F W Isherwood, A Knight, A Starkey, halves ; R A Dale, J Pearson, D Travis, If Parker,E Banks, forwards. Bus, leaves Academy 1.10 p.m. The second elevens meet at Latchford and the home team is :—H Wright, goal ; T Dixon, H T Gibbs, backs; H Eccles, A E Bradshaw, T Banks, halves ; H R Colton, H Fletcher, W Minards, F Laver, J T Smith,forwards. Bully-off 2 15 p.m.</p>
