        <p>There are two ways to tell whether you have kidney trouble.</p>
        <p>The firat is by pains in theback and other out- ward signs. The second Is by the condition of the kidney excretions. That is why physicians make such a careful examination when you apply for life insurance, and if there is any sign of kidney disease you are sure to be rejected.</p>
        <p>Kidney disease is so dangerous that it is a bad mistake to overlook or neglect it ; and if you get pains in the back, recurring heidacbes, rheumatic twinges, or generally feel tired, drowsy and irritable, lose no time in beginning with Doan's Backache Kidney Pills. They correct and regu- late kidney excretions, stimulate and heal dis- ordered kidneys, and so drive away backache, rheumatic pains, lumbago, dropsy, gravel, dizzy turns, and other results of kidney trouble.</p>
